# The pass WITHOUT Odyssey (TESTING.md T2), selected by name:
#
#   -DepMap wsl-deps.without-odyssey.map -Filter 05-without-odyssey.feature
#
# A line starting with '!' leaves that DLC out of ModsConfig for this pass. Its Data folder stays,
# so what is switched off is the activation, nothing else. Core and typos are refused by the staging.
# The report carries the pass name, taken from this file name: without-odyssey.
#
# Nothing else is staged: this is the bare pass, minus one DLC. Whether the game KEEPS the DLC out
# of a loaded save is the open question of this pass; 05 asks the game itself, twice.
!ludeon.rimworld.odyssey

# The two steps that ask ModsConfig whether an expansion is active live in PickleTools, a repository cloned
# under the collection root; the path is relative to it, and the folder's About.xml packageId must match.
nelim.pickletools.expansions   path:PickleTools/ExpansionSteps/Mod
